; A bucket account completes only a transaction that has exactly one
; posting (src/xact.cc, xact_base_t::finalize: "posts.size() == 1").
; This two-posting transaction is an implicit exchange: C++ infers the
; cost of the AAPL posting from the dollar posting, the transaction
; balances, and the bucket receives nothing.  The semantic
; bisimulation (test/semantic/check_all.py) replays this journal, so an
; oracle that completed the residual into the bucket would fail here.

bucket Equity:Bucket

2024/01/01 Buy
    Assets:Broker   10 AAPL
    Assets:Cash     $-500

test bal --flat
             10 AAPL  Assets:Broker
               $-500  Assets:Cash
--------------------
               $-500
             10 AAPL
end test
